  "content": "\n\n<h1>物品欄擴充 - yyz 的背包模組</h1>\n<p><strong>直接整合背包</strong><br>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c7ebd872683a4f5860d80ac023b9a0674a9c4f9.gif\" alt=\"show\" width=\"385\" height=\"223\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1d862f817680bcf1cbec51827a8020691d9c7c97.gif\" alt=\"craft\" width=\"390\" height=\"226\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2d03ad242b88889756076fae21bd2e2871698735.gif\" alt=\"save\" width=\"390\" height=\"226\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/011b793aa53f969f2ec6d5257f7603bc56789ca1.gif\" alt=\"pick\" width=\"390\" height=\"226\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/05c7b41411b7a40589213223687065285ee8da74.png\" alt=\"model\" width=\"784\" height=\"458\"> &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🌟 模組特色</h2>\n<h3>⚡ 無縫介面整合</h3>\n<p>背包欄位會直接顯示在<strong>工作介面</strong>（物品欄／工作台／箱子等）中，無需開啟額外的介面。</p>\n<h3>🛠️ 強化功能</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>🖱️&nbsp;<strong>物品移動</strong><br>Shift+滑鼠左鍵 → 移至主物品欄 &nbsp;<br>Shift+滑鼠右鍵 → 移至背包物品欄<br>雙擊 → 自動整理物品 &nbsp;</li>\n<li>📦&nbsp;<strong>自動拾取</strong><br>當物品欄滿時，自動將物品存入背包<br>死亡時背包會以單一物品形式掉落（內容物保留）</li>\n<li>🔥<strong>JEI/REI/EMI 整合</strong><br>支援在<strong>JEI/REI/EMI 合成介面中直接使用背包物品</strong><br>配方介面即時顯示背包內容</li>\n<li>💍&nbsp;<strong>飾品欄位支援</strong><br>背包可裝備於<strong>Curios/Trinkets 欄位</strong>中</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🎒 背包等級</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>背包類型</th>\n<th>額外欄位數</th>\n<th>特殊能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>木製</td>\n<td>+9</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>石製</td>\n<td>+18</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鐵製</td>\n<td>+27</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金製</td>\n<td>+36</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鑽石製</td>\n<td>+45</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>獄髓製</strong></td>\n<td><strong>+54</strong></td>\n<td><strong>火焰免疫</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>⚙️ 相容性&nbsp;</h2>\n<p>若畫面無法正常顯示，請前往查看：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyyzs-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/yyzs-backpack</a></p>\n<h3>圖例說明</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>✅&nbsp;<strong>完全相容</strong></li>\n<li>⚠️&nbsp;<strong>部分支援</strong></li>\n<li>⌛&nbsp;<strong>規劃中</strong></li>\n<li>❌&nbsp;<strong>不支援</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>功能支援狀態</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>1.21.6</th>\n<th>1.21.5</th>\n<th>1.21.4</th>\n<th>1.21.2-1.21.3</th>\n<th>1.21.1</th>\n<th>1.20.5-1.20.6</th>\n<th>1.20.2-1.20.4</th>\n<th>1.20.1</th>\n<th>1.19.4</th>\n<th>1.19.3</th>\n<th>1.19-1.19.2</th>\n<th>1.18-1.18.2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>JEI</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Curios</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trinkets</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quark</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accessories</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REI</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EMI</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inventorio</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IPN</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inventory Sorting</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D Models</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Doggy Talents Next</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AE2</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>❓ 為什麼選擇這個背包？</h2>\n<p>傳統背包模組＝需要額外開啟介面的行動式箱子。我們的解決方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>無縫體驗</strong>&nbsp;- 直接在<strong>工作介面</strong>中存取背包物品</li>\n<li><strong>原生互動</strong> - 完整支援配方書與<strong>JEI/REI/EMI</strong></li>\n<li><strong>背包切換</strong>&nbsp;- 將背包放入背包欄位或內部時可進行切換</li>\n<li><strong>持續擴充</strong>&nbsp;- 持續增加模組相容性支援</li>\n</ol>\n<p>未定義</p>\n<h2>⚠️ 目前狀態</h2>\n<p><strong>本模組目前處於非常早期的開發階段。若您發現任何錯誤，可透過 GitHub 或 Discord 回報</strong><br>❗ 遇到問題或有建議？&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/yyz729/yyzsbackpack/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f3NPKBgXxVU\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>🔧 <strong>開發中項目</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更多介面支援</li>\n<li>背包 3D 模型</li>\n<li>擴充模組相容性</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>✨&nbsp;<strong>設計理念</strong>：讓背包成為主物品欄的自然延伸</p>\n</blockquote>",
